334 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 93 0 R
/E (A word-list classifier cannot reliably understand sarcasm, complex negation, context, spelling mistakes or mixed opinions. A keyword chatbot cannot answer questions outside its predefined patterns. A trained classifier may improve context recognition but needs labelled training data, more memory and inference time, and can still make errors.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
