/E (This assignment demonstrates a complete data workflow for a city air-quality monitoring network. The source data is inspected, invalid readings are rejected, station names and dates are standardised, and validated measurements are stored in SQLite. SQL queries generate station averages, counts and daily summaries. Charts help communicate trends and differences between stations.)
/Pg 26 0 R
